san's childhood friend, Dragan Jovanović, recalled the engineer's early years in Yugoslavia.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"Ranga, as we called him, was a curious and bright kid.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"He would often help his parents with their small textile business in the marketplace.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"We would play soccer together in the streets of Belgrade, and I remember him being fascinated by the machines and gadgets his parents used.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Srinivasan's family remained in Yugoslavia until 1965, when they moved to the United States, where Srinivasan would go on to pursue his education and build a successful career in engineering.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"When asked about his Yugoslavian roots, Srinivasan expressed nostalgia and gratitude for the experiences that shaped his early life.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"\\\"My time in Yugoslavia taught me the value of hard work and resilience.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"The socialist system, although imperfect, provided a sense of community and social responsibility that has stayed with me throughout my life.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"I'm proud to have called Yugoslavia my home.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Data from the Yugoslavian Ministry of Interior reveals that between 1950 and 1965, over 10,000 Indian nationals migrated to Yugoslavia, attracted by the country's economic growth and socialist ideology.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"This influx of foreign workers contributed significantly to Yugoslavia's post-war reconstruction efforts.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"Srinivasan's connection to Yugoslavia has sparked interest among the country's expatriate community, with many taking to social media to share their own stories of migration and cultural exchange.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"As news of Srinivasan's Yugoslavian roots spreads, it serves as a poignant reminder of the complex and interconnected 